{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Triggers the “Login for Admin” flow for the active login session associated with the given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"login view controller. Forces browser-based (advanced) authentication via ASWebAuthenticationSession,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of org configuration, to support phishing-resistant MFA."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"loginViewControllerDidSelectLoginForAdmin"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"loginViewController"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SalesforceLoginViewController","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SFLoginViewController","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.salesforce.mobilesdk.SalesforceSDKCore\/documentation\/SalesforceSDKCore\/SalesforceLoginViewController"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"loginViewController","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The login view controller whose scene’s active auth session should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to “Login for Admin”. Its window’s scene is used to locate the session."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This performs the same action as selecting “Login for Admin” from the login screen’s settings"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"menu. Apps that hide the settings menu (e.g. by setting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showSettingsIcon = NO"},{"type":"text","text":") can call this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to expose the feature f